Zero point energy                ...      0.11734799 Eh      73.64 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00782607 Eh       4.91 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
